is proves that Willie and  Aaron were definitely not working  together because it turns out that  Willie was not the Warhammer type  after all and the theory I proposed in  my recent where is the Warhammer Titan  video was true which is pretty cool I  have to say as Eden wrecks havoc around  the festival area killing a whole bunch  of civilians including Sofia and we also  see that Udo is terribly injured if not  killed as well it is revealed that the  true Warhammer Titan was another member  of the Tiber family  Willie's sister now this makes perfect  sense to me  the timers would want to keep the  Warhammer Titan power as safe as  possible so lying that Willy has it when  someone else does is actually a good way  to protect themselves in case somebody  tries to go after them I think this is a  good strategy as the sister begins to  transform Eren flies at her right away  and start doing damage he's not waiting  for the transformation he's jumping in  right away like a true soldier using  every possible second to his advantage  as Willy had already predicted most of  the male leadership is wiped out by  Aaron's attack and general McGrath  assumes command he prepares anti-titan  cannons in order to attack Aaron's  attack Titan and he also makes a comment  about going to the island implying that  the Marlin military plans to use the  fact that the founding Titan isn't male  2 now attack parodies however why do  they need to go to the island if the  founding Titan is right here we learned  that my gas no longer considers  capturing the founding Titan a priority  he believes that the era of Titan  dominance is over and he orders Eren to  be killed I wonder does McGrath want to  go to the island in order to kill all  the audience there is it connected to  the female Titan and rescuing any in  some way or is it just about the  resources that the island has I'm not  sure at this point but let me know what  you guys think  why does my gas want to go to paradise  even though the founding Titan is right  there in front of him we soon learned  that the Warhammer Titans special  ability seems to be to create weapons  including a giant spike that shoots up  from the earth to impale Eren and of  a hammer it's as if this Titan uses the  ability that Titans have to harden their  bodies in a way that allows it to create  powerful weapons that are not connected  to its body  I wonder if back in the days of the LDN  Empire the Warhammer time actually  created powerful weapons for the other  shifters to use in battle  we then see Porco and peek inside the  underground dungeon and the theories  that some of you mentioned in the  comments on the previous chapter reviews  were true peek was suspicious of the  soldier that led them to the trap so she  instructed the one soldier she briefly  hugged to follow them and see where the  mystery soldier is taking them the  soldier peak spoke with rescue speak and  pour core and they make their way back  up to the street but as they do this  they see the survey Corps from parodies  storming lab area with their 3d  maneuvering gear which is just an epic  scene and a massive development back at  the festival Plaza the Warhammer Titan  has fully transformed and with the help  of the male military cannons the  Warhammer Titan manages to take out the  attack Titans head with its hammer and  then we see Eden emerging from the  attack Titan in all of his long-haired  glory the Warhammer Titan speaks to Eren  asking if he has any final words and of  course we know that the Tiber family is  a noble family so that could be related  to why the Warhammer Titan can speak so  clearly in Titan form we know of course  that Zeke who also has royal blood can  do the same but then just as we think  that Eden might be about to get hammered  he says do it now Mikasa and the survey  Corps shows up including our girl Mikasa  who launches a bunch of thunder spears  into the Warhammer Titans neck while the  other survey Corps members go at it with  the Marlins soldiers  Mikasa says Aaron please come home and  this is how this epic chapter ends Mika  says hair by the way is even shorter  than before even though I was personally  hoping for longer but she is still as  amazing as  there are so many questions right now  clearly Aaron was communicating with  Mikasa and the survey Corps at some  point because they showed up just in  time but you'll notice that Nika sucess  - Aaron please come home so that implies  that Eden has been male on his own at  least for a while and Mikasa wants him  to come home so that means that this  plan may have been Aaron's idea and  Mikasa wasn't fully on board out of the  survey Corps we appear to have also seen  Jean or Jean very briefly but still no  Levi Sasha  Connie or the others and of course know  Armin who is the Colossus Titan I wonder  if Armin is here waiting to make his  move or if maybe he is still on paradise  waiting for the Marlin army to make  their move so that he can stomp them out  we can't forget that Porco and peak will  now transform into their Titan forms and  the Warhammer Titan is probably still  alive somehow since I doubt it would go  down so easily  not to mention Reiner who is still there  in the underground chamber and of course  Zeke should be there somewhere but I am  definitely now willing to bet that Zeke  is working with Aaron in some capacity  Zeke knew what was about to happen he  made sure that Porco and peek were out  of the way he made sure that Reiner went  into the underground room to talk to  Aaron and I'm willing to bet that Zeke  helped Aaron organize this plan in the  first place and maybe that's why Mikasa  wants Eren to come home because she  doesn't trust Zeke and she knows that  Aaron is working with it so the  situation as we have it now is pretty  intense to say the least we have  multiple Titan shifters loyal to Marlay  that could spell disaster for Eren  Mikasa and the others but we also have  the survey Corps 