e any  innocent people die if the Colossus  Titan is indeed in Marlay and they are  keeping him hidden it is because Eren  Mikasa and the others are still doing  their best to avoid civilian casualties  if they can help it overall it is just  very hard to predict what happens next  but give me your thoughts down in the  car  do you like the design of the Warhammer  Titan and do you think that it has an  impressive power personally I was  thinking that we might see something  related to lightning since the Warhammer  is associated with Thor the God of  Thunder in Norse mythology and we know  that attack on Titan is heavily  influenced by Norse mythology but to be  perfectly honest I still think this  Warhammer Titan design is pretty cool  and the power seems very impressive also  another huge question for me  what is Zeke up to where was he in this  chapter as the chapters have been going  on I keep getting more and more curious  about Zeke and his true intentions also  when will Levi make his move I can't  wait to see him again and of course I  can't wait to see Arman's Colossus Titan  form finally what about Reiner how do  you think he feels now that the tables  have been turned and his hometown has  been attacked by Eden and the survey  corps what will he do next will he fight  will he try to stop the fighting because  he knows there are good people on both  sides or will he just wallow in  depression give me your thoughts down  below I love to hear from you thank you  again for all the support you've shown  regarding the whole last review being  taken down it's a hard thing to deal  with but again thank you so much if you  enjoy these reviews and want to see more  be sure to leave a like to let me know  if you're new to the channel be sure to  subscribe and hit that notification bell  so you can be notified every time I  upload a new review as always thank you  so much for watching and until next time  see us space cowboys  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

